  {
   "id": "skautfold-shrouded-in-sanity-19481@major-2020-05-31",
   "gameId": "skautfold-shrouded-in-sanity-19481",
   "displayName": "Update on 3rd of June.",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-05-31T16:36:22.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "On the 3rd of June the game will receive a massive update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Significant parts of the game were remade from the ground up, a detailed list of changes will be provided with the update when it goes live.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPORTANT!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Existing save games will NOT be usable after the update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Due to how the game was coded originally, and how awful the existing save system is, existing save games will be unusable. I apologize for the inconvenience but there was no easy way to offer a legacy load option.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "JOIN OUR DISCORD",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As always, we strongly recommend that you join our Discord server if you want to be completely up-to-date, or just want to hang out. We are extremely active on there, posting updates and screenshots most days. And if you're worried about spoilers, we have dedicated rooms for those, so they're easy to avoid. It's also super convenient for us to receive bug reports since you can post images, but it's also a direct way to give us suggestions and other comments.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "OUR STEAM GROUP",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Alternatively, if you don't use Discord, please consider joining our developer page here on Steam to get the latest news and updates, discuss any Pugware game, or report issues:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Pugware Steam Group",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pugware",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
